  "title": "Cornmeal Bacon Waffles with Cheese Sauce",
  "description": "Great for brunch. A nice alternative to sweet waffles, these cornmeal waffles are ironed with a slice of bacon, and served with a creamy cheese sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "juliacooks"
  ],
